# v3 corpus artifacts. The shard tree is generated, large, and reproducible
# from the plan plus a teacher; `dataset/examples/v3/` holds the committed
# picture of what a row looks like.
dataset/shards/
dataset/publish/

# Teacher transcripts (amendment §A). Debug, never corpus: they carry the
# factory's own brief, which is the one thing a student row may not, and a
# transcript inside the repo is a transcript something will eventually train
# on. Written only when COSIMO_V3_KEEP_TEACHER_MESSAGES=1.
**/teacher_logs/
dataset/examples/v3/_teacher_logs/*.json
